# AshyTV free catalog — curated list of links, released under CC0 1.0.
# AshyTV hosts nothing: every entry points to the official source or to the
# Internet Archive. Criteria: explicit open licence, or films published up to
# 1955 that are in the public domain both in the United States (copyright not
# renewed) and in Brazil (70 years after publication, Law 9.610/98 art. 44).
# Silent films are left out: their soundtracks were often added later.
# Removal requests: https://github.com/big-comm/ashytv/issues

